            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're managing trucks, you already know this: downtime costs more than just money. It affects your drivers, your schedule, and your reputation with customers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That's why more fleet owners are shifting away from reactive fixes and investing in fleet maintenance programs instead. At Sun State International, we've seen firsthand how the right approach to maintenance can change the way a business runs. Whether you're running a small operation or managing a growing fleet, the choice between a fleet preventative maintenance program and one-off repairs can make a measurable difference in your bottom line. Let's break it down in a straightforward way.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-are-programs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Are Fleet Maintenance Programs?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-are-programs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-are-programs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A fleet maintenance program is a structured, proactive plan designed to keep your trucks running efficiently through scheduled inspections, servicing, and part replacements. Instead of waiting for something to break, you're staying ahead of issues.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-are-programs-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "A typical truck fleet maintenance program includes:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-what-are-programs-3",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Routine oil and filter changes"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake inspections and replacements"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Tire rotations and alignments"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Fluid checks and system diagnostics"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Scheduled DOT inspections"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-are-programs-4",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "It's about consistency and prevention.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-one-off-repairs",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Are One-Off Repairs?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "one-off-repairs"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-one-off-repairs-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "One-off repairs are exactly what they sound like. Something breaks, and you fix it. There's no long-term strategy, just reacting to problems as they come up. While this approach might seem cost-effective upfront, it often leads to:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-one-off-repairs-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Unexpected downtime"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Larger repair bills"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Missed delivery deadlines"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Increased wear on other components"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-one-off-repairs-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you have an issue with any of your trucks, our Service Department at Sun State International is here to help. With mobile service, extended hours, and a dedicated team, we're here to get your fleet running when you need it most. Schedule your service appointment to get started.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-one-off-repairs-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-one-off-repairs-4",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
                          "borderStyle": "solid",
