                {
                  "id": "h-why-they-work",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Why Fleet Preventive Maintenance Programs Work",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "why-they-work"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-why-they-work-1",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "1. They Reduce Downtime",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "reduce-downtime"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The biggest advantage of a fleet preventative maintenance program is keeping your trucks on the road. When you're maintaining systems regularly, you catch small issues before they turn into major failures. For example, replacing worn brake pads early prevents rotor damage, monitoring engine diagnostics avoids costly breakdowns, and regular inspections catch leaks before they escalate.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That means fewer surprises and more control over your schedule.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-why-they-work-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "2. They Extend the Life of Your Trucks",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "extend-life"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your trucks are one of your most important investments. A consistent truck fleet maintenance program helps protect that investment by:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-why-they-work-6",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Reducing wear and tear"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improving engine performance"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Maintaining fuel efficiency"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Instead of replacing trucks sooner than expected, you're getting the full value out of them.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-why-they-work-8",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "3. They Improve Safety and Compliance",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "safety-compliance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-9",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Staying compliant with DOT regulations isn't optional. A structured maintenance program ensures regular inspections are completed, safety issues are addressed immediately, and documentation is kept up to date.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-10",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This not only protects your drivers but also helps you avoid costly fines or failed inspections.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-why-they-work-11",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "4. They Keep Your Business Running Smoothly",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "run-smoothly"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-12",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Owner-operators and fleet managers don't have time to chase repairs. A maintenance program simplifies everything: scheduled service appointments, clear maintenance timelines, and fewer emergency situations.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-why-they-work-13",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "At Sun State International, we focus on making service straightforward and efficient, because we know your time matters.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-keep-moving",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep Your Fleet Moving",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "keep-moving"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-keep-moving-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you're ready to take control of your maintenance strategy, having access to the right parts and service makes all the difference. Browse our Online Parts Store to find dependable OEM parts quickly, or schedule a service appointment with Sun State International and stay ahead of repairs.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "links-keep-moving-2-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "links-keep-moving-2",
                      "type": "column",
