                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-establish-program",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "How to Establish a Truck Fleet Maintenance Program",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "establish-program"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-establish-program-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If you're wondering how to establish a truck fleet maintenance program, it starts with a few key steps.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-establish-program-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Step 1: Evaluate Your Fleet",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "step-1"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-establish-program-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Look at truck age and mileage, usage patterns (long haul vs local), and past maintenance history. This helps determine service intervals.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-establish-program-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Step 2: Set a Preventive Schedule",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "step-2"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-establish-program-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Create a schedule based on manufacturer recommendations, mileage benchmarks, and seasonal demands (especially in Florida conditions). Consistency is what makes the program effective.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-establish-program-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Step 3: Track Everything",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "step-3"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-establish-program-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Keep records of repairs, inspections, and part replacements. This gives you visibility into trends and helps you plan ahead.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-establish-program-8",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Step 4: Partner with a Reliable Service Provider",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "step-4"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-establish-program-9",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "This is where many businesses make or break their program. You need a reliable partner who communicates clearly, works efficiently, and understands your business. At Sun State International, our goal is to provide dependable service that keeps your fleet running without unnecessary delays.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-when-one-off-makes-sense",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When Do One-Off Repairs Make Sense?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "when-one-off-makes-sense"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-when-one-off-makes-sense-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "There are situations where one-off repairs are unavoidable, such as unexpected accidents, emergency roadside breakdowns, or isolated component failures. But relying on them as your primary strategy is where problems start. The most successful fleets use one-off repairs as a backup, not a system.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-build-a-plan",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Build a Maintenance Plan That Works",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "build-a-plan"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-build-a-plan-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "If your goal is to reduce downtime, control costs, extend the life of your trucks, and keep your drivers safe, then a fleet maintenance program isn't optional; it's essential. At Sun State International, we understand that your business depends on reliability. That's why we focus on providing quality parts, efficient service, and straightforward support that helps you stay on the road. Whether you're maintaining a small fleet or scaling your operation, the right support makes all the difference. Order parts or schedule service with Sun State International to get the best performance from your fleet.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "actions-build-a-plan-2",
                  "type": "buttons",
                  "props": {
                    "align": "left",
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "ctaId": "order-parts-online",
                        "label": "Get the Parts You Need Without the Wait",
                        "style": "primary"
                      },
                      {
